=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-301202 nc.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7f/Spine_static-301202_nc.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"259\" height=\"549\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"259\" data-file-height=\"549\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3012\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%84%E8%87%A3\" title=\"弄臣\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%84%E8%87%A3\" title=\"弄臣\"><img alt=\"弄臣\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-301201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5b/HeadIconSmall-301201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%84%E8%87%A3\" title=\"弄臣\">弄臣</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.5</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>旧卷新谈</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：301202</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">每到年节的时候，镇子里时常有一个皮影戏班来访，他们技艺精绝，皮影跃于幕中，栩栩如生。围观者众多，将道路堵得水泄不通，掌声雷动，欢声震天。<br />时间久了，镇上的人都好奇戏班主的来历，虽然多方探问，始终没有人知晓更多。某日，有稚童悄悄揭开戏班主的衣袍，发现他身子薄得像是一张皮影。<br />忽然天地间大风起，所有皮影离架纷飞，凌空搏击，铮铮有声。众人目眩神迷之时，倏地听见一声朗笑——戏班主抛一长索，长索直上入云，他攀索而上，身影同长索都渐渐消失在大家视野里。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"301202\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301204.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/72/Belonging-301204.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">特制皮影道具<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Lantern Shadow Puppet</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />33<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一件灯笼模样的皮影道具，从选材、上色到组装、调试，全由受访者一人独立完成。其精巧的灯面、细腻的色彩搭配，无一不透露出受访者的细致、耐心，以及对戏剧的热忱。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301205.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/22/Belonging-301205.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“不小”的荷包<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">A \"Small\" Purse</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>无人知晓受访者的荷包里，究竟放有怎样的物什。<br />“世上满是数不清的舞台，而每个舞台，亦演绎着数不清的戏剧。因此，想必您也看得出，这荷包绝无可能装下我看过的所有故事。”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301206.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7b/Belonging-301206.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“戏中人，戏外人”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Inside and Out of the Play\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>“您瞧见了什么，您听见了什么？这儿有一场专为您准备的戏，对，只要您在，它就永远不会落幕。”<br />受访者脸上总戴着面具，纵使出演的剧目类型不同，但他却比任何人都清楚，戏剧终局的走向。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 影子巧挑班1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD1.jpg/203px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"203\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD1.jpg/305px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD1.jpg/406px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 影子巧挑班2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD2.jpg/203px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"203\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD2.jpg/305px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD2.jpg/406px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%BD%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A7%E6%8C%91%E7%8F%AD2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1200\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">影子巧挑班 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Shadow Play Master</small></span></span>"}}